{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act45side_level_act45side_st01",
  "groupId": "act45side",
  "stageId": "act45side_st01",
  "title": "Red Light at the Crossroads",
  "storyCode": "SS-ST-1",
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "df06de2f0a58c03adb34b3dfcfd589d7628120accdc080aab309da078f942e85",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nyamu Yūtenji",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Today's masquerade is another huge success!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nyamu Yūtenji",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Did you hear how loud they were cheering for the encore? I bet that one kid was a <i>total</i> Nyamuchi fan!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nyamu Yūtenji",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Like, her eyes were glittering like crazy when I came on stage! Man, that makes me happy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nyamu Yūtenji",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We should add a little more fan interaction to our next show, whaddaya say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's one thing to think of ways to increase appeal, Yūtenji-san, but do not lose sight of Ave{@nbs}Mujica's worldview."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nyamu Yūtenji",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Bleeeh... What, you afraid I'll steal the whole audience away?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nyamu Yūtenji",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "My fans are just here to soak up Ave{@nbs}Mujica's masquerades. Why not hook them on Mujica itself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Your very posture is a part of the performance. We must not let our guards down until the curtains have truly fallen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It is our mission to see our guests enraptured in this masquerade."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We must therefore present a convincing image—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nyamu Yūtenji",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alright, alright."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nyamu Yūtenji",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Saaay, Muuko, didn't <i>you</i> get the biggest cheers when you took the stage?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nyamu Yūtenji",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You were happy, weren't you? You wanted even more fans, didn't you? Be honest."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mutsumi Wakaba",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I... don't..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Stop trying to incite Mutsumi, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Uika Misumi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Haha... come on, no arguing..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nyamu Yūtenji",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I just think everyone's looking forward to the next performance—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nyamu Yūtenji",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We've got so many people on our side right now. Here's our chance to repay them by giving our all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Uika Misumi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Saki-chan's doing her best to compose the new song. The light in the loft's been on so late these past few days..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Be assured that in the face of all your efforts, I can hardly rest on my own laurels."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Uika Misumi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Saki-chan..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nyamu Yūtenji",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sakiko, real talk. Remember to chill out a little."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Uika Misumi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We all get what you're putting into this, Saki-chan. I'll make sure the lyrics are worthy of the new song."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Umiri Yahata",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Togawa-san played me a sample before the show. It's a good song."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Uika Misumi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, if I had to say, maybe... the tempo could be a tiny bit slower?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nyamu Yūtenji",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Huh?! You all heard it already? When??"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Uika Misumi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just before the show today. I think you weren't in the dressing room?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I wanted to get the opinions of everyone, but time was short, so I simply played it for those present."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mutsumi Wakaba",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Nyamu made me go on her livestream as a guest... I didn't get to hear it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nyamu Yūtenji",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Guh...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yūtenji, didn't I say not to—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nyamu Yūtenji",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "L-Look, the light's turning green! We can talk about this on the other side!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*sigh* What a headache..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Uika Misumi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...It's so wonderful."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hm? What's this all of a sudden?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Uika Misumi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I was touched by what you were saying just now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Uika Misumi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Even after all we went through, even though we've fought, the five of us are still together as a band... It's so wonderful."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Uika Misumi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I've never asked them, but I'm sure everyone thinks that way... I know I do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Uika Misumi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "As for me, I'm so glad you can put your trust in me this way, Saki-chan."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Uika Misumi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I could offer my whole life to Mujica, I really could!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sakiko follows Uika's gaze. A group of girls are merrily crossing the road.\nThey are unburdened, free of cares, as if this were all a beautiful fairy tale."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Uika Misumi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Though none say it out loud, they all owe a debt of gratitude to their Saki-chan. In Nyamu's own words, Mujica made her dreams come true."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A dream..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Uika Misumi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's like how everything used to be... It's almost like we're dreaming."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Huh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Dreaming?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Uika Misumi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Come on, you two, let's not do this here..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are you telling me to cast aside our identity as a band?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nyamu Yūtenji",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, band or not, I don't care."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nyamu Yūtenji",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I mean, is there any reason we have to be a <i>band</i> for this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What in the world are—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nyamu Yūtenji",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Besides, I don't hear Muuko complaining. Hell, she's the one who said 'it won't last' on TV."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nyamu Yūtenji",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Never mind being a band, I don't think she'd lose too much sleep over leaving Mujica."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mutsumi Wakaba",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That was—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Uika Misumi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...I won't let Mujica disband."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nyamu Yūtenji",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Where'd you get that from? I didn't say anything about disbanding."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Uika Misumi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A member leaving is the same as us disbanding. And it's a betrayal of our fans' support."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nyamu Yūtenji",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And what I'm saying is, we've already betrayed it just now. Besides, you talk a big show for someone too damn busy to show up to practice, don't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Uika Misumi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nyamu Yūtenji",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's just irresponsible, isn't it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Uika Misumi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How could you...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If we're dealing in <i>responsibility</i> here, then I'd like to say you're the one who needs more practice, Yūtenji-san!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Umiri Yahata",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I've never felt Yūtenji-san to be lacking in practice. Togawa-san, aren't you the one not paying attention to your band members here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Uika increases her pace to catch up with the other members who have gone ahead, but Sakiko lags dazedly behind the crowd.\nShe stares blankly at the flashing signal. Her legs feel as though they've been filled with lead. She can't put a single step forward."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nyamu Yūtenji",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey! What are you standing there for?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Umiri Yahata",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Did you leave something behind?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mutsumi Wakaba",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Saki. The light's turning red."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Uika Misumi",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Saki-chan?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nyamu Yūtenji",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We're not gonna wait for you if you don't keep up!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The traffic signal beeps its urgent warning. Sakiko tries to follow, but the light has turned red."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Car after car flies past. Sakiko lifts the wind-frayed tips of her hair. The traffic light highlights her face in silhouette.\nSomething falls into her palm."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is this... rain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Raindrops plummet from the sky, faster, heavier.\nA torrent of memories comes rushing back—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The sound around her amplifies. The noise of the crowd and the horns of cars batter her eardrums.\nRain soaks into her clothes, becoming one with her tears.\nHer sorrow and helplessness cannot be told, yet the way she cries towards the sky tells all.\nMelancholy and despair sweep over her, and her vision grows blurry along with the memories."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Clank, clunk."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sakiko? Sakiko!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mm... hmm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Time to get up, sleepyhead! It's a beautiful day."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "M... Miss Vigna? Am I dreaming...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Nope."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Excuse me, don't pinch my face!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm not pinching that hard. Just doing the check for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Pinches own face) See? Not that bad."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're not the one getting face-pinched without warning first thing in the morning!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alright, alright, I'll lay off. Go get yourself ready; I'll wait for you outside."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She presses her ear against the cool wall. The whir of the mobility layer transmits through the structure of the landship.\nClank, clunk."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So that was the sound of the mobility layer..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What was that strange scene... and those people?"
    },
    {
