    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Unfamiliar vehicles, unfamiliar buildings, unfamiliar clothing..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Could it be a movie?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, sometimes I watch documentaries before I go to bed, and then I dream about being in those places..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But I haven't experienced anything close to this before..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Maybe you're just tired?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Whislash was telling me how you always train until way late. Apparently you don't even stop until she tells you to."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And I think I saw your name on the Engineering Department's volunteers list..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're still pretty new here. You've got plenty of time and plenty of chances to adjust."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Maybe take a little vacation if you're feeling tired? Give yourself a break."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm fine, I can deal with it..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flustered Operator",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "M-Miss Sakiko! A hand, please!"
